# Representation theory: target signatures

The roadmap is `README.md`; this file is not the roadmap. It is the acceptance test of the
index page `TauCetiRoadmap/RepresentationTheory/README.md`, which states the roadmap's headline
theorems against the pinned Mathlib and Tau Ceti.

The index page owns no headline theorem of its own. The family is split into self-contained
sub-roadmaps (semisimple algebras, character theory, induction and restriction, modular induction,
compact groups, Lie groups, Ado and Iwasawa, root systems, Lie highest weight, classical groups,
Schur-Weyl duality, spin representations, quiver representations), and each sub-roadmap states its
headline theorems in its own `Suggested.lean` beside its `README.md`; for instance the
faithfulness of the standard geometric representation of a Coxeter group is stated in
`RootSystems/GeometricFaithfulnessTargets.lean` as RootSystems §3G. Restating any of them here
would plan them a second time, so this file states nothing: no headline of the index page is
unstatable at the pins, there is simply none that is not owned by a sub-roadmap.
-/

